                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "TIRED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Welcome to Halloween Carnival!",
                            "zh": "欢迎来到万圣嘉年华！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Did you know? The earliest jack-o'-lanterns weren't made from pumpkins.",
                            "zh": "你知道吗？最早的杰克灯并不是用南瓜制作的。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Back then, the Irish used root vegetables like turnips to make jack-o'-lanterns.",
                            "zh": "那时候爱尔兰人用芜菁之类的根茎类蔬菜来制作杰克灯。"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Jack-o'-lanterns made from turnips? Would that make them even spookier?",
                            "zh": "用芜菁做的杰克灯？那会更吓人吗？"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
